# Per-machine defaults for the secondaries aktualizr-default-sec registers ("1") or not ("0"),
# matching what each machine has registered so far. A new machine's configuration sets
# TORIZON_SECONDARY_* with "?=" (a plain assignment there would override local.conf). Torizon Cloud
# accepts a new ECU later, but rejects one that disappears and returns.

